type: software
title: "CiSS 2.0 — Circular Sustainability Scorecard"
abstract: >
  Generic computational algorithm for measuring the degree of balance
  between circular sustainability dimensions in organizations of any sector.
  Based on Porto (2021), formalized under Ijiri's (1975) axiomatic measurement theory.
